Z||000007||mindscape||07-18-2001||10:18 AM||||I'm not buying new fuel injectors.  I priced a set from Standard Motor Products, about $80 each.  Then again, if a set of Multecs will work, a used set can be had for next to nothing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||Alex4mula||07-18-2001||11:51 AM||||Have anyone seen the new ones offered by Accel? They come in 19lbs/hr and on. Cost is around $220 for 8 at Jegs/Summit catalogs. That's about $28/injector and its new. Just to consider.<P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red & White (:<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p69fbfe3e99ec5a0b81c10afcc578ff95/fe6d5c42.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
